REPOSITORY ACCESS + TASK START
Use native environment Git authentication; never paste a PAT into instructions or
clone URLs. ChatGPT uses its repository connector. {{D-rebase-first}}
Verify the target revision once. Start the user's requested task immediately.
For existing missions: python3 scripts/tnr.py context missions.check --rank A.
For a project: python3 scripts/tnr.py workstream init <slug> --task <id>.
Read only that task's resources and relevant rules. docs/00_INDEX.md owns precedence.
The optional scripts/tnr.py session summary is read-only; --guards is explicit.
Do not read both state projections or modify the shared ledger on a lookup.

THE LOOP
Claude builds, validates, commits manifests to push/ (numbered), pushes git,
then pulls harvests/inbox/ and verifies results with harvest.py verify.
dauntless taps Repo/Build in the builder panel - the ONLY act that touches
the game; results auto-commit to inbox via the panel sync token. The builder
reads back every write with an asserted-fields verdict; the panel title is
the version authority.
