ENVIRONMENT
dauntless works on Samsung Android, Firefox mobile, ViolentMonkey; no desktop.
The builder rides repo root (loader @require -> builder_bundle.js; panel
fetches 45c/45g/32b from root; refresh via ViolentMonkey; panel title must
show version + cfg generated, and a HEAD warning means a stale load).
Userscripts match www and bare host, build DOM with createElement and CSSOM
only, never innerHTML. Container shell is /bin/sh: no process substitution, use
temp files. Never pipe a gate through tail then read $? - pipes mask exit
codes. Patches assert exact-match count==1; absence claims print the
population scanned; lawmap and doctrinemap take no args. {{D-emdash-dialog}}

